---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Programs FAQ"
  description="Operational details for the Castalia Programs GitHub Pages deployment and domain setup."
>
  <main class="programs-page section">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h1>FAQ</h1>
      <p>Initial notes for operating this repository as the programs catalog.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="faq">
      <li>Builds run on GitHub Actions and publish automatically on pushes to `main`.</li>
      <li>The custom domain is declared via the repository `CNAME` file as `programs.castalia.institute`.</li>
      <li>DNS should point the subdomain at GitHub Pages using the repository’s final Pages target.</li>
      <li>The frontend is Astro, while the shared shell comes from the vendored `@castalia/platform` package.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
